y2017d3p1←{
	n←n-~2|n←⌊⍵*.5    ⍝ side-length of inner square
	d←(n+1)|⍵-n×n     ⍝ distance anti-clockwise from corner
	(⌈n÷2)+|d-.5×n+1  ⍝ (from centre to side) + (to middle of side)
}
